73868_2837147585257716785_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hUEUxxd8QLUQ7kNvwHQ7pO1&_nc_oc=AdrIIL_CVS6lI1Ykx_N9Q5wEepRl_nD8pNsMbWDBdBDri87SqC8V0C8nBQFoR5bf2Ko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNowBQ7vOxRX5GWr2A-S3Wj35HUfQZAQ-XWp_QuKHePTQ&oe=6AC3AD71"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "7.png", "id": "987855227103410", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618288_987855230436743_1667690147683302764_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yXTu_aDLYsYQ7kNvwGfZZb3&_nc_oc=AdqLn76EUzDElVDcpRQ6ABqjNEG4Rl7yc3-p704e35a2llC2gb5EbRqXD29P7V1Ubeo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNNNXvRgM6gN8UsmyyzHRxJmeFh1Q5Bsf5bG6NtzW0LqQ&oe=6AC3A7B4"}, "display_name": "Kanvaz", "keywords": ["painting", "coloring", "relaxing", "art", "paintbynumber"], "long_description": "Kanvaz is an easy and satisfying paint-by-number experience designed for relaxation and short sessions.\n\nChoose a template, follow highlighted zones, relax, and bring your masterpiece to life - no skill required.\n\nAuto-correction system: your strokes snap perfectly into place - fast, effortless, and impossible to mess up (you can disable the auto-correction system to play without support if you want extra challenge).\n{2485077265240201}\n\nCreative Freedom: you can still adapt the artworks to your own style\n{820673347777876}\n\n80-artworks pack, across a variety of themes\n{2158152335045372}\n\nRelaxing environments: 5 different moods, and passthrough mode\n{988961566892343}\n\n", "short_description": "An easy, satisfying, and relaxing paint-by-number experience. Choose a template, follow highlighted zones, and create beautiful art - no skill required."}]}, "developer_name": "Kanvaz Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://notasquare.notion.site/Kanvaz-Privacy-Policy-344d2dcc8f9580298830e4374505ecdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kanvaz S